{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（13日）下午1時50分，牛頭角彩霞道休憩處對開發生車禍，一輛的士疑失控鏟上行人路，撞到兩名女途人，兩人均重傷昏迷，其中一人送院後證實不治</p><p>救援人員到場將兩名30餘歲的女傷者送往聯合醫院搶救，七旬男司機、一名男乘客及一名女乘客同樣胸口痛一併送院。警方正在現瑒調查。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131249035433218048819502.jpeg/p2KtRa4OqieQ6u37vhoPnAyMZ0p22D74vbHqCZex6gk\" alt=\"大批消防員在現場救援。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>大批消防員在現場救援。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131248783040974848567143.jpeg/lTK86qArWANtnXTrU2EROAROAZq9masiIC8JBCAvCQQ\" alt=\"救護員將一名傷者送上救護車。\"><figcaption>救護員將一名傷者送上救護車。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131243566924828672125693.jpeg/KMNLiO7xrCKTdx3C7GhQ2a_vPI6rdQI0l22OEJdtjhA\" alt=\"的士車頭損毀。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>的士車頭損毀。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131242709135134720962503.jpeg/94Mmb01hXoIHW-qJZDjUze1kzsdNAigk3wiI9t8IiPY\" alt=\"警方及消防員在場處理車禍。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>警方及消防員在場處理車禍。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131244068337094656940658.jpeg/-NEgLyfuCm-UYSEr1RWqxyQrVJA3PXgDjAHBIYwBwSE\" alt=\"現場是彩霞道近振華道。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>現場是彩霞道近振華道。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131244071583617024819362.jpeg/pm8XFPNOi6UklzK3Zc9aq_KKY2tAqB6a0ojX-9KI1_s\" alt=\"消防員在場處理。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>消防員在場處理。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131244074440069120649725.jpeg/kQY-BPpYsn2xhFrH4UPkjFVWJh6-Yxwh3vCXOd7wlzk\" alt=\"消防員在場處理。（馬耀文攝）\"><figcaption>消防員在場處理。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-13T07:35:54.470858+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}